          {
            "title": "Question: List",
            "id": 82835,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"usernames = \" /><text value=\"&quot;aut_43 tommo rodger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"usernames_list = usernames.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(usernames_list)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>aut_43 tommo rodger</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika pemanggilan diubah menjadi <code>usernames.split(\"_\")</code>, apa yang akan disimpan <code>usernames_list</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"usernames = \" /><text value=\"&quot;aut_43 tommo rodger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"usernames_list = usernames.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(usernames_list)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['aut', '43 tommo rodger']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['aut', '43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['aut', '43 tommo rodger']</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: After variable",
            "id": 82834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan <code>split()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini membagi string menjadi sebuah list</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini menggabungkan string</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ini mengganti sebagian string</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini membagi string menjadi sebuah list.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah program menjalankan <code>\"Ada Lin\".split()</code>. Nilai mana yang dikembalikan pemanggilan tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">List <code>['Ada', 'Lin']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">String <code>AdaLin</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">String <code>Ada Lin</code> dengan spasinya diganti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih List <code>['Ada', 'Lin']</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
