            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tetapkan ulang variabel asli ke nilai yang diperbarui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"yearly = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Discount increased to 2%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yearly = yearly.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;4%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(yearly)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"43\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount increased to 4%\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>yearly</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Replace",
            "id": 82806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perbarui variabel <code>release_date</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"release_date = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Release date: 24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = release_date.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;31st August&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"count\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"split\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Release date: 31st August\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>release_date</code>, diikuti oleh <code>replace</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ganti tanggal lama dengan yang baru agar konsol menampilkan <code>Release date: 31st August</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"release_date = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Release date: 24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = release_date.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;24th July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;31st August&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"count\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"split\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;31st August&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Release date: 31st August\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>release_date</code>, diikuti oleh <code>replace</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"24th July\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Displaying",
            "id": 82802,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi ketika kita menetapkan ulang hasil yang diberikan oleh <code>replace()</code> ke variabel asli?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Variabel tersebut berisi nilai yang telah diperbarui dan kita bisa menggunakannya seperti biasa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini akan menyebabkan error dalam kode kita</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nilai di dalam variabel asli tidak akan diperbarui </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Variabel tersebut berisi nilai yang telah diperbarui dan kita bisa menggunakannya seperti biasa.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah program menyimpan <code>draft report</code> dalam <code>title</code>, lalu menetapkan kembali <code>title.replace(\"draft\", \"final\")</code> ke <code>title</code>. Apa isi <code>title</code> sekarang?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>final report</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>draft report</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Error karena title sudah memiliki nilai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>final report</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
