            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wales + Ireland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;and&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Wales and Ireland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Wales and Ireland</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Wales + Ireland</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>WalesandIreland</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Wales and Ireland</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah kode ini dijalankan, pernyataan mana yang menjelaskan kedua variabel?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wales + Ireland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;and&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Wales and Ireland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>answer</code> tetap berisi <code>Wales + Ireland</code>, sedangkan <code>updated</code> berisi <code>Wales and Ireland</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kedua variabel berisi <code>Wales and Ireland</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>answer</code> tetap berisi <code>Wales + Ireland</code>, sedangkan <code>updated</code> berisi <code>WalesandIreland</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>answer</code> tetap berisi <code>Wales + Ireland</code>, sedangkan <code>updated</code> berisi <code>Wales and Ireland</code>.</p></body></html>",
